 to sort of view it in the context of, you know, the whole world going direct-to-consumer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/12/02/snowflake-inc-snow-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"SNOW 2021 Q3","e":"snow","d":"2021-12-01","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Frank Slootman","x":"You know, every industry is -- even people that have historically not been direct-to-consumer, you know, are moving toward direct-to-consumer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/12/02/snowflake-inc-snow-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"SNOW 2021 Q3","e":"snow","d":"2021-12-01","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Frank Slootman","x":"I mean, even industries that historically have not been direct-to-consumer, I think of retail and things of that sort, retail, obviously, the brick-and-mortar type, they're all changing now under the influence of the likes of Instacart and DoorDash.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/12/02/snowflake-inc-snow-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"SNOW 2021 Q4","e":"snow","d":"2022-03-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Raimo Lenschow","x":"Mike, if you look at other vendors, if they have product improvements that actually saves their customer cost, they usually have a sharing model of like the customer gains something and you gain something through maybe like price increase, etc. Is that something that over time could happen?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/03/02/snowflake-inc-snow-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"SNOW 2022 Q2","e":"snow","d":"2022-08-24","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"DJ Hynes","x":"You raised the guidance to 17% this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/24/snowflake-inc-snow-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"SNOW 2022 Q4","e":"snow","d":"2023-03-01","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Tyler Radke","x":"Mike, going back to your comments on the bookings slowdown at the end of the quarter, how much of that was driving the lower outlook for the full year versus actual consumption slowdown that you saw?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/03/01/snowflake-snow-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SNOW 2023 Q1","e":"snow","d":"2023-05-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Derrick Wood","x":"And when it comes to pricing, you know, you talked about customers focusing a lot on cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/24/snowflake-snow-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SNOW 2023 Q2","e":"snow","d":"2023-08-23","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Frank Slootman","x":"You can only run direct-to-consumer businesses, you know, with data.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/23/snowflake-snow-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SNOW 2023 Q2","e":"snow","d":"2023-08-23","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Kirk Materne","x":"And then, Frank, just as you spoke to a lot of executives at Summit, do they recognize the fact that the road to AI does require, perhaps, a heavier level of investment than they were thinking 12 months ago?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/23/snowflake-snow-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SNOW 2023 Q2","e":"snow","d":"2023-08-23","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Patrick Colville","x":"But clearly, like AI spend is hitting the silicon layer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/23/snowflake-snow-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SNOW 2023 Q2","e":"snow","d":"2023-08-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Derrick Wood","x":"You can streamline a lot more workflows, which I think when it comes to building AI models seems pretty interesting.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/23/snowflake-snow-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SNOW 2023 Q2","e":"snow","d":"2023-08-23","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Keith Weiss","x":"W