oss margins associated with new product features.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/26/snowflake-snow-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SNOW 2024 Q4","e":"snow","d":"2025-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sridhar Ramaswamy","x":"More and more customers are switching to Snowflake and realizing the incredible ease of use and cost savings our platform delivers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/26/snowflake-snow-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SNOW 2026 Q2","e":"snow","d":"2025-08-27","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Sridhar Ramaswamy","x":"And we have extended our connectivity platform with Snowflake OpenFlow, making it easy to bring in structured, unstructured, batch, or streaming data.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/27/snowflake-snow-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SNOW 2026 Q2","e":"snow","d":"2025-08-27","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Brent Thill","x":"You raised the guide more than the beat quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/27/snowflake-snow-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SNOW 2026 Q2","e":"snow","d":"2025-08-27","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Sridhar Ramaswamy","x":"And part of what we are figuring out in this moment is AI is going to disrupt potentially everybody, including us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/27/snowflake-snow-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SNOW 2026 Q4","e":"snow","d":"2026-02-25","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Sridhar Ramaswamy","x":"We are broadening how data enters and flows through Snowflake Inc. Snowflake OpenFlow, now generally available, makes it easier than ever to bring in structured, unstructured, batched, or streaming data into the platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/25/snowflake-snow-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SNOW 2026 Q4","e":"snow","d":"2026-02-25","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Brian Robbins","x":"So AI has really changed the framework for investing in growth—no longer tied to headcount.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/25/snowflake-snow-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SNOW 2026 Q4","e":"snow","d":"2026-02-25","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Sridhar Ramaswamy","x":"I think, to step back and look at the impact that AI as a whole is having on software—we spend a lot of time looking at this.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/25/snowflake-snow-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SNOW 2026 Q4","e":"snow","d":"2026-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sridhar Ramaswamy","x":"By enhancing enterprise search with easy-to-use knowledge chatbots and streamlining contract management through Document AI, Toyota has fundamentally shifted its development timelines, reducing AI agent deployment from months to weeks, creating a significant competitive advantage.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/25/snowflake-snow-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SNOW 2026 Q4","e":"snow","d":"2026-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sridhar Ramaswamy","x":"By running these workflows directly in Snowflake Inc., Sanofi is streamlining operations while keeping its data securely within the platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/25/snowflake-snow-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SNOW 2027 Q1","e":"snow","d":"2026-05-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Sridhar Ramaswamy","x":"Just today, we announced an expanded collaboration with AWS through a new $6 billion multiyear agreement to accelerate enterprise AI adoption globally, leveraging Graviton compute and AI services.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/27/snowflake-snow-q1-2027-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SNOW 2027 Q1","e":"snow","d":"2026-05-27","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Brian Robins","x":"Given the strength we've observed in both our core data platform business and AI business, we are raising our guidance for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/27/snowflake-snow-q1-2027-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SNOW 2027 Q2","e":"snow","d":"2026-09-02","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Sridhar Ramaswamy","x":"We are also doing a job of sharing best practices across the different theaters in the globe.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/09/snowflake-snow-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SNOW 2027 Q2","e":"snow","d":"2026-09-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Brian G. Robins","x":"Because we have increased our guidance so much.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/09/snowflake-snow-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[44,1,8885,0,0,0,6590,1809],[45,1,8144,1,1,0,5759,1965],[46,1,8585,0,0,0,6375,1563],[47,1,9502,0,0,0,6443,2527],[48,1,8560,0,0,0,6247,1730],[49,1,9129,0,0,0,6323,2273],[50,1,8859,0,0,0,6474,1724],[51,1,6726,0,0,0,4989,1257],[52,1,9133,0,0,0,6620,1829],[53,1,9204,0,0,0,6625,1996],[54,1,8962,0,0,0,6087,2020],[55,1,7771,0,0,0,5600,1452],[56,1,8500,1,1,0,5768,1949],[57,1,8785,0,0,0,7162,1188],[58,1,8896,0,0,0,6203,2202],[59,1,9256,0,0,0,7101,1590],[60,1,8949,0,0,0,7520,953],[62,1,8324,0,0,0,5946,1788],[64,1,6320,0,0,0,5133,671],[65,1,7921,0,0,0,6773,0],[66,1,8834,1,1,0,7261,1138]],"cinema":[[44,1,8885,0,0,0,6590,1809],[45,1,8144,0,0,0,5759,1965],[46,1,8585,0,0,0,6375,1563],[47,1,9502,0,0,0,6443,2527],[48,1,8560,0,0,0,6247,1730],[49,1,9129,0,0,0,6323,2273],[50,1,8859,0,0,0,6474,1724],[51,1,6726,0,0,0,4989,1257],[52,1,9133,0,0,0,6620,1829],[53,1,9204,0,0,0,6625,1996],[54,1,8962,0,0,0,6087,2020],[55,1,7771,0,0,0,5600,1452],[56,1,8500,0,0,0,5768,1949],[57,1,8785,0,0,0,7162,1188],[58,1,8896,0,0,0,6203,2202],[59,1,9256,0,0,0,7101,1590],[60,1,8949,0,0,0,7520,953],[62,1,8324,0,0,0,5946,1788],[64,1,6320,0,0